   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "A hypothesis",
   "texto": [
    "**-(으)면** serves for possible or general conditions; **-다면** poses the condition as a supposition or scenario. It does not imply that it is false or impossible in itself: the context decides whether to translate «Yes» or «If I was».",
